 "text": "Geographic Information Services | Lincoln County, SD\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nAbout Us\nDepartments\nGovernment\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nInteractive Property Maps\nHome\nDepartments\nPlanning & Zoning\nGeographic Information Services\nGeographic Information Services\nResponsibilities\nThe County's Geographic Information System ( GIS ) integrates county records and other information to enable a better understanding of spatial relationships.\nThe County Parcel Browser and other online GIS maps combine administrative and informational layers to support county departments and other agencies with administration, planning, and regulation, and to inform the public. Services include:\nAddress management\nFloodplain determination\nSite and plan review\nBoundary and data updates\nParcel corrections and editing\nContact Us\nGeographic Information Services\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n104 N Main Street\nSuite 240\nCanton , SD 57013-1708\n104 N Main Street Suite 240 Canton SD 57013-1708\nDirections\nPhone: (605) 764-0101\nBids & RFPs\nEmployment\nVoter Information\nProperty Tax\nInteractive Maps\nAgendas & Minutes\nContact Us\nLincoln County Courthouse\n104 N Main Street\nCanton, SD 57013\nContact Us\n8:00 am – 5:00 pm\nMonday - Friday ( Excluding Holidays )\nImportant Links\nCommission\nElections\nGIS\nMarriage Licenses\nSheriff\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nBESbswy BESbswy BESbswy\nClose ×",
